          "text": " Ku naamureebire, naagwa aha bigyere bye nk'ofiire. Kwonka yantaho omukono gwe gwa buryo naagira ati: Otatiina; niinye w'okubanza kandi ow'aha muheru, mbwenu ohuriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaba nfiire, mbwenu ndi ohuriire ebiro byona; kandi nyine ebishumuruzo bya Rufu n'Okuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu handiika ebi waareeba, ebiriho kandi ebiribaho bwanyima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakuru g'enyonyoozi mushanju ezi waareeba omu mukono gwangye gwa buryo, kandi n'ebikondo by'etabaaza mushanju eby'ezaabu, ezo nyonyoozi mushanju nibo baamaraika b'ago makanisa mushanju, kandi ebyo bikondo by'etabaaza mushanju nigo makanisa mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
